The server bundles presets.json, fields.json, preset_categories.json and the en and cs
translations of @openstreetmap/id-tagging-schema 7.3.0
(https://github.com/openstreetmap/id-tagging-schema), copied from node_modules at build time,
Copyright (c) iD Contributors, ISC License.

The map style reproduces iD's look (https://github.com/openstreetmap/iD), Copyright (c) 2017 iD
Contributors, ISC License; at build time the web app bundles from the @openstreetmap/id package its
icon sprites (dist/img/*-sprite.svg) and area fill patterns (dist/img/pattern/*.png), and ports iD's
line, area, vertex, pin and pattern styling rules.

The web app bundles presets.min.json from id-tagging-schema
(https://github.com/openstreetmap/id-tagging-schema), Copyright (c) iD Contributors, ISC License, for
preset icon matching.

Icons in iD's sprites come from:
- Temaki (https://github.com/rapideditor/temaki), CC0 1.0
- Maki (https://github.com/mapbox/maki), CC0 1.0
- Pinhead (https://github.com/waysidemapping/pinhead), CC0 1.0
- Font Awesome Free (https://fontawesome.com), icons under CC BY 4.0
- Roentgen (https://github.com/enzet/Roentgen), CC BY 4.0

